  "content": "<media-image source=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/haxtheweb/art/main/haxtheweb/hax-of-the-web/poster.png\" alt=\"Arcade title screen: a pixel-art zombie pirate girl in front of a haunted house under a full moon, beside dripping horror letters reading HAX of the Web, with PRESS START below.\"></media-image>\n<p>A Halloween arcade title screen starring the rpg-character's zombie pirate girl (the element's zpg seed). Type cheat codes, ask Merlin, or press start to drop into a real HAXcms site and edit it.</p>\n<p><em>A homage to the title screen of a 1990s light-gun zombie arcade game. Its art, audio and text are all original.</em></p>\n<simple-cta link=\"https://haxtheweb.github.io/art/haxtheweb/hax-of-the-web/\" label=\"Play HAX of the Web\"></simple-cta>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://hax-of-the-web.surge.sh/\">Also live on surge</a></li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/tree/main/haxtheweb/hax-of-the-web\">Files, alt text and credits on GitHub</a></li></ul>"
